WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:13.651
Kip shook the snow off his head.

2
00:00:13.652 --> 00:00:20.427
"Who threw that snowball?" he asked.

3
00:00:20.428 --> 00:00:22.158
Bird looked up.

4
00:00:22.159 --> 00:00:25.356
Snowy branches were above Kip.

5
00:00:25.357 --> 00:00:29.570
"Nobody threw a snowball, Kip," said Bird.

6
00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:33.396
Kip wasn't listening.

7
00:00:33.397 --> 00:00:35.948
He looked around.

8
00:00:35.949 --> 00:00:40.425
"Maybe Frog threw it," said Kip.

9
00:00:40.426 --> 00:00:44.407
"Frog is asleep for the winter," said Bird.

10
00:00:44.408 --> 00:00:48.540
"The snow came from—"

11
00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:51.371
"It was Squirrel!" said Kip.

12
00:00:51.372 --> 00:00:53.800
"I think he's awake."

13
00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:56.716
Bird sighed.

14
00:00:56.717 --> 00:00:59.910
"We need a snow fort," said Kip.

15
00:00:59.911 --> 00:01:02.816
"Then we'll be safe."

16
00:01:02.817 --> 00:01:06.327
Kip made a wall out of snow.

17
00:01:06.328 --> 00:01:15.810
"We don't need a snow fort," said Bird.

18
00:01:15.811 --> 00:01:28.923
Kip kept working.

19
00:01:28.924 --> 00:01:34.349
Soon Kip's snow fort was finished.

20
00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:37.368
Squirrel walked over.

21
00:01:37.369 --> 00:01:39.302
"Hi, Kip."

22
00:01:39.303 --> 00:01:41.432
Kip frowned at Squirrel.

23
00:01:41.433 --> 00:01:45.542
"Did you throw a snowball at me?" he asked.

24
00:01:45.543 --> 00:01:49.814
"No, why?" asked Squirrel.

25
00:01:49.815 --> 00:01:55.182
A strong wind blew.

26
00:01:55.183 --> 00:01:57.925
Snow fell on Kip and Squirrel.

27
00:01:57.926 --> 00:02:02.375
"Someone threw a snowball!" they both cried.
